invalid type: string "Design Phase\nDecides how the system will operate in terms of the hardware,\nsoftware, and network infrastructure that will be in place.\nSteps:\n1 Design Strategy:\nBuild in-house.\nOutsource.\nHybrid solution.\n2 Architectural Design:\nLayered architecture.\nClient-server.\nMicroservices.\nDeliverables:\nArchitecture Document.\nDatabase ERD.\nUI Prototypes.\nHLD and LLD.\n: